"{{Term/Store|EX Treasure: Merchant Hood||Series, BotW}}" is a [[Side Quest]] in {{BotW}}.<ref>{{Cite|{{Big|EX Treasure: Merchant Hood}}<br/>{{Color BotW|Side Quest|Deya Village Ruins}}|Adventure Log|BotW}}</ref> It is exclusive to {{TCB}} [[Downloadable Content]] pack.

==Overview==
This [[Side Quest]] is obtained upon leaving the [[Great Plateau]] and loading the overworld of [[Hyrule Kingdom]], which can be done by [[Warping]], reloading a save file, dying, or leaving an [[Ancient Shrine]]. When the Quest is activated, [[Link]] will be tasked with finding ''[[Misko's EX Journal 2]]'', which is rumored to be in the [[Deya Village Ruins]].<ref>{{Cite|Somewhere in the {{Color BotW|Red|Deya Village Ruins}} is a journal that places the location of this treasure ...|Adventure Log|BotW}}</ref>{{Note|It is possible to activate the second stage of this Side Quest by reading ''Misko's EX Journal 2'' without triggering any of the loading conditions for its activation.}}

Inside ''Misko's EX Journal 2'' are clues to the locations of six [[Treasure Chest]]s, each containing a priceless relic stolen from [[Hyrule Castle (Dungeon)|Hyrule Castle]] by [[Misko]].<ref>{{Cite|I hid the six priceless relics I stole from Hyrule Castle in treasure chests... I shall write down their locations. -{{Color BotW|Blue|Misko}}|Misko's EX Journal 2|BotW}}</ref> The Journal states the hood of the [[Ravio|traveling merchant]] can be found in the right hand of the Dragon at [[Dracozu Lake]] that consumes the [[Spring of Courage]].<ref>{{Cite|The traveling merchant's hood is {{Color BotW|Red|in the right hand of the dragon that consumes the Spring of Courage at Dracozou Lake}}.|Misko's EX Journal 2|BotW}}</ref>

The Treasure Chest can be found buried underneath the right hand of the dragon statue at the Spring of Courage. Using the [[Magnesis]] [[Rune]], Link can pull the Treasure Chest out of the ground and open it. Once he obtains [[Ravio's Hood]], the Side Quest will be complete.<ref>{{Cite|You found the treasure chest in the right hand of the dragon ruins at Dracozu Lake and obtained {{Color BotW|Red|Ravio's Hood}}!|Adventure Log|BotW}}</ref>

